          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot me mony bitedo karama pi rok ducu i wi got Cion, karama ma gicamo iye riŋo mogo makur, ki mato koŋo vino ma ocek mamit adada, ki riŋo ma miyu, ma moo ma i cogo dwoŋ iye ata, ki koŋo vino ma giliyo woko maber ka doŋ ocek mamit adada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok Rwot biyeco boŋo ma giumo ki rok woko ducu, i wi got man, ki kitambara ma gubedo ka rukone i kare me kwero cola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
