              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno gibiwaco ni, “Nen, man aye Lubaŋawa ma wabedo ka kurone pi larowa. Man aye Rwot ma wabedo ka kurone-ni; wabedu doŋ ki yomcwiny pi kit ma en olarowa kwede.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
