                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ciŋ Rwot biywe i wi got Cion, ento Moab mere gibinyono woko piny i kabedone, kit macalo dyaŋ’ nyono kwede reŋ kal i bur mna gionyo iye cet dyaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Moab biryeyo badgi i dyere kit ma dano mo ma tye ka kwaŋ ryeyo kwede bade me kwaŋ; ento Rwot bimiyo wakkegi gik woko kacel ki dito ma gitye kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Celgi ma gugero ma ocudo malo likuŋ ca gibidwoko woko piny, ka gicoro gireto woko piny i lobo, poto wa i apwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
